#. Selecting Reject (recommended setting) will configure the server to only\naccept mail for valid email addresses (for example users, groups, pseudonyms).\nMail for other addresses will be rejected.
msgid "mai_DESC_UNKNOWN"
msgstr ""

#. You can scan incoming and outgoing e-mail for viruses. If scanning is enabled and a virus is detected, the e-mail will be rejected and returned to the\nsender.
msgid "mai_DESC_VIRUS_SCAN"
msgstr ""

#. You can enable or disable webmail on this system. Webmail allows\nusers to access their mail through a regular web browser by\npointing the browser to https://[_1]/webmail,and \n logging in to their account.
msgid "mai_DESC_WEBMAIL"
